Error [E0225]: `show` only reads this argument, so it takes no `&` mark
  --> write_mark_on_read_param.jet:8:10
    |
  8 |     show(&score)
    |          ^
 Why: A mark shows that a call writes (`&`) or takes (`^`) the named place; `show` declares this parameter read-only, so the call leaves the place unmarked
 Fix: Remove `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0225
